  "notable_quotes": [
    "CO2 uptake increased with functionalization and then declined, with maxima at intermediate compositions such as MAC-4-AB-0.5 and MAC-4-AC-0.5 at 298 K and 1 bar.",
    "The SSF/MTV-MOF approach allowed tuning functional-group ratios (x = 0.3, 0.5, 0.7) in MAC-4-AB/AC/AD/AE without changing the framework.",
